---
interface Props {
  class?: string;
}

const { class: className } = Astro.props;
---

{/*
  The Universidad de La Laguna's símbolo — the two chamfered strokes, without
  the wordmark, which is the form the identity manual uses at small sizes.

  Traced from the university's own asset, because they publish no vector: the
  brand pages under ull.es/portal/marca ship PNG previews only. The outline was
  read off the pixels of that PNG rather than drawn by eye, and checked back
  against it — every edge is axis-aligned or a true 45° chamfer, and the
  remaining difference is the reference's antialiasing against this one's hard
  edges. Replace it if the official vector ever becomes available.

  It inherits `currentColor` rather than carrying the corporate purple
  (#670290). The mark sits inline in a sentence beside a monochrome GitHub
  glyph, and one saturated logo in that row reads as a mistake rather than as
  branding. Monochrome is a permitted treatment in their manual.
*/}
<svg
  viewBox="0 0 148 118"
  class={className}
  role="img"
  aria-label="Universidad de La Laguna"
  fill="currentColor"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
>
  <path d="M38 0 L38 80 L72 80 L72 88 L39 118 L0 118 L0 36 Z" />
  <path
    d="M38 0 L38 80 L72 80 L72 88 L39 118 L0 118 L0 36 Z"
    transform="translate(76 0)"
  />
</svg>
